-- !! scores and tuition fees are generated by a deterministic formula. They are NOT real figures and must never be
-- !! shown to students as such. Rows are flagged is_sample = true and the API repeats that flag in its responses.
-- !! Replace them with real, sourced data (admin API or an import) before going live.

